supernatural has a fandom second to none  millions love the dark fantasy series  and the actors who are part of it but  where was the cast before all of this  fame  let's uncover some of the roles of the  supernatural stars before they were  slaying demons and raising hell  before jensen ackles was saving people  and hunting monsters on supernatural  he already had a variety of credits to  his name the texas native's first big  break came on the long-running soap  opera days of our lives  he played eric brady for 54 episodes  ackles also had a recurring guest role  on the biggest teen drama of the new  millennium  dawson's creek he left the world of  soaps behind in 2000 for a significant  role in james cameron's tv series dark  angel  the two-season fox show familiarized him  with the world of sci-fi which he  continued to explore in a 22-episode arc  on smallville where he played assistant  football coach jason teague  while fans can't possibly imagine ackles  as anyone but the scruffy older  winchester brother  he actually tried out for sam before  snagging his iconic role as dean  before jared patalecki started slaying  demons as sam winchester the actor  played  dean forrester rory gilmour's first love  on gilmore girls  he was part of the show from the 2000  pilot through 2005.  so both ackles and padalecki had a  working relationship with the wb  turned cw network prior to landing their  respective supernatural roles  in 2004 patalecki starred in the mary  kate and ashley olsen film new york  minute  playing the love interest to mary kate's  character roxy  stepping away from his more comedic  roles padalecki then played john davis  in the desert island film flight of the  phoenix  right before his supernatural debut he  starred as wade in the horror film house  of wax  a part that prepared him for his career  as a ghoul hunter in the creeptastic  world of supernatural  action horror romance this is one actor  who's done it all  misha collins brought a boatload of new  fans to supernatural upon making his  season 4 debut as castiel  before that he made his mark on  hollywood with a range of roles  between his portrayal of alexis drazen  on 24 to  appearing in procedurals like csi crime  scene investigation  er ncis csi new york and without a trace  collins kept plenty busy he also starred  with laura prepon  in carla his most regrettable film to  date collins played serial killer paul  bernardo  collins told fans to avoid the movie  happily collins himself is nothing like  the character having started the charity  random acts  and running gishwhes a hugely popular  charitable international scavenger hunt  before jeffrey dean morgan literally  made head's role as negan on the walking  dead he played sam  and dean's revenge driven father on  supernatural  but even before that the actor already  had a host of acting credits to his name  yet morgan didn't always dream of being  an actor  unlike most hollywood origin stories  acting basically fell into morgan's lap  when he helped a friend move to los  angeles  following his debut as sharky in uncaged  morgan went on to appear in tv series  like walker texas ranger  er csi crime scene investigation star  trek enterprise  monk the oc and weeds that's a lot of  guest star roles  his movie credentials are just as vast  but acting isn't morgan's only passion  he and friend paul rudd co-owned samuel  sweet shop in rhinebeck new york  the duo saved the shop from closure when  the owner passed in 2014.  morgan told jimmy fallon he passed away  suddenly  and we didn't want the story to be  anything else than what it was when  samantha smith took on the role of mary  winchester on supernatural  she likely expected her first week on  set to be her last  not many characters who die in the pilot  episode end up coming back after all  especially not ones who get burned to  death yet smith's warm and compelling  performance as mama winchester cemented  her as a fan favorite and the writers  kept finding new ways to write her back  into the show  but before she brought the og winchester  hunter to life and death smith had a  vast number of acting credits to her  name in the early 90s  she scored tv roles in seinfeld pacific  blue  friends and two of a kind she then  kicked off the 2000s with her role as  kate wilton  on profiler jim beaver's performance as  bobby singer a surrogate father to the  winchester brothers resonated  immediately with many fans  however before beaver donned a wardrobe  of plaid and baseball caps to hunt  monsters  he had already amassed a whole slew of  acting credits  before beaver became an actor he entered  the us marine corps just after his high  school graduation in 1968. following his  return to the u.s beavers scored his  first acting role in 1977 on semi-tough  for the next three decades he guest  starred in a multitude of tv shows  including matlock reasonable doubts nypd  blue and third rock from the sun  he also earned significant roles in  shows like the young and the restless  and days of our lives  not long after a stint on the show the  ranch beaver starred in deadwood from  2004 to 2006 ending shortly after his  run  on supernatural began supernatural has  brought a lot of couples together  one particularly prominent duo emerged  when then genevieve cortessi was cast as  ruby in season four  she and jared padilecki sam ended up  finding love in a demonic place  today they are married with three  children but before the couple was  canoodling on screen or in real life  genevieve padilecki earned a bundle of  acting credits  the actress had stints on death valley  the dead zone kids in america  and salted nuts beginning in 2004 a year  later genevieve landed a 51-episode lead  role in the tv series wildfire  while jensen ackles and d'neill ackles  formerly harris didn't find love on the  supernatural set  she was a late addition to season 13 she  plays sister joe  a vapid angel disguised as a healer  prior to her arc on supernatural denial  had significant guest spots on tv series  like one life to live  what i like about you and joey the  friend spin-off  danielle's biggest claim to fame was her  role as rachel in 51 episodes of the cw  teen drama one tree hill though jansen  and denial had previously met their  relationship bloomed after they starred  in the indie film 10-inch hero  the film chronicles the lives of  sandwich shop workers featuring a  delightfully feminist denial as priestly  following this film denial played a few  small roles on various tv shows before  landing a larger part in the short-lived  show friends with benefits as far as  movies are concerned she had parts  in the back-up plan the roommate and a  very herald and kumar christmas  before felicia day played charlie  supernatural's hacker turned hunter the  actress had already carved out a  significant corner of the nerd culture  sphere  though she'd had a few small prior roles  her eight-episode arc as vi on the  seventh season of buffy the vampire  slayer put her on the map  day went on to star and bring it on  again and had a variety of smaller roles  in shows like monk  and undeclared she landed her second  joss whedon project in 2008 when she  played penny in the cult classic dr  horrible's  sing-along blog in 2007 day created the  guild  a web series inspired by day's love of  world of warcraft  they even created a music video for the  project do you want to date my avatar  which riffs off the idea of becoming an  idealized and often  unattainable version of yourself online  from 2009 to 2010  day appeared in two episodes of a third  whedon project  dollhouse did you catch this classic  line from dean in the episode lucifer  rising  how about this the sweet life of zach  and cass  the show's playful pun was to honor kim  rhodes then a new guest star who starred  on the disney channel show  the suite life of zack and cody from  2005 to 2008  but before either role the actress had a  long list of acting credits to her name  rhodes first made waves as cindy in  another world a character she played  again  in as the world turns from there she  landed a series of guest roles in shows  like martial law  star trek voyager touched by an angel  without a trace and csi crime scene  investigation  a year before her stint on the suite  life of zack and cody rhodes had a small  role in christmas with the cranks  rob benedict richard spright jr and matt  cohen made a splash at conventions  together back around supernatural season  5.  rob benedict's band loudon swain has  since become  a staple at conventions and no one  throws a costumed karaoke shindig like  sprite jr and cohen  benedict and sprite jr even created a  series together called kings of khan in  which they chronicle convention  shenanigans often alongside cohen  but where were they before they became  supernatural icons  spray junior came on to the acting scene  in 1984 earning spots on tv movies and  series including er  running the halls and freddy's  nightmares later he earned roles in  shows like band of brothers  the agency and jericho like day benedict  had a stint on buffy the vampire slayer  but instead of playing a slayer  benedict played a vampire the actor also  played significant roles in felicity  birds of prey  come to papa and threshold before  snagging the role of chuck  aka god on supernatural prior to his  2008 supernatural episode cohen launched  his acting career in 2005 with tv movie  and series roles including how to get  away with murder  south of nowhere and medium you can't  have lucifer without crowley and you  can't have mark pellegrino without mark  shepard  before the duo's battle for the title of  king of hell however shepard and  pellegrino  enjoyed vibrant careers in hollywood  launching his acting career in 1987  pellegrino's big break was playing billy  phelps in lethal weapon 3.  from there he went on to projects like  midnight witness the big lebowski  and a murder of crows by the 2000s  pellegrino had already amassed dozens of  roles  going on to appear in four episodes of  nypd blue and eight of dexter  before taking on lucifer before signing  on to supernatural in 2009 most fans  probably recognized mark shepard from  his appearances on like-minded shows  including charmed  star trek voyager and firefly shepard  got his start before those series  however in 1992 as eddie bryce in the tv  series  silk stockings he went on to appear in  20 episodes of soldier of fortune  and had numerous roles in shows like  sliders 24 and battlestar galactica  supernatural has gone through more than  its fair share of major guest stars but  few have made quite as big of a splash  as  alexander calvert who plays jack the son  of satan  calvert won fans over instantly amassing  a sea of immediate jack stands  but before supernatural the actor got  his start in 2005 with a small role  in the dead zone his career immediately  took off earning him guest roles on  shows like psych  the troop and bates motel he went on to  play larger roles in arrow and the movie  edge of 17 before landing jack  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite stuff are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

